        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia Regal Entrance Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Omnia entrance handleset has decorative grooves across the handle and on the inside trim. The Regal id the simple answer to the vintage design aesthetic that is so popular. It is basic enough to effortlessly add just the right amount of retro detailing to your rooms; and also because its design is so simple, this handleset is capable of beautifully integrating into whatever furnishing you have without having to overhaul your entire décor.</p>\r\n<p>\r\nEach set contains door levers, backplates, mortise latchset, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates. Key functions are supplied with lock cylinder/s and turnpiece as applicable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC1_size.gif?v=1704354673\" width=\"400\" heigth=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Features</b> of the Regal Entry Handleset: \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" solid brass throw with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable armored steel front for beveled conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass curved lip strike: 4-7/8\" high by 11/4\" wide with a 11/4\" lip to center. Finished to match trim. Dust box shipped with set.</li>\r\n<li>The Omnia <b>Max Brass</b> are guaranteed never to tarnish even in extreme elements. Especially recommended for harsh environments such as salty air.</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Regal Handlseset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1-3/4\" door thickness standard.</li>\r\n<li>Available with either 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Plate Length: 17-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Plate Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 10-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li><b><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-mortise-handleset-data-sheet.pdf?v=1704262251\" target=\"new\">Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions (PDF)</a></b></p>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>When Selecting a Function</b>:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Standard:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside. The outside is operated by a thumbpiece outside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and turnpiece inside.</li>\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside and a thumbpiece on the outside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and turnpiece inside. Turning of inside knob or lever will retract both dead-bolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside. The outside is operated by a thumbpiece. Deadbolt activated only by key on both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n<p><i>The inside trim will match the handleset finish.</i></p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Regal Entrance Handleset Omnia",
                "description": "Omnia Regal Handleset - This Omnia entrance handleset has decorative grooves across the handle and on the inside trim. The Regal id the simple answer to the vintage design aesthetic that is so popular. It is basic enough to effortlessly add just the right amount of retro detailing to your rooms; and also because its design is so simple, this handleset is capable of beautifully integrating into whatever furnishing you have without having to overhaul your entire décor.",
